ll,["zh-Hant"],[["週日11:28抵達，未排到第一批入場\n等候20分鐘後入場😌\n不怕燙的人完食大約12分鐘，該用餐限制半小時太趕的人拜託不要來佔位\n\n・蜜桃拉麵🍑僅販售到2026.7.12・\n初訪，直接被這碗蜜桃拉麵圈粉\n\n以水果入菜，預期會是甜口，殊不知仍然以鹹為基調，這樣的設計更符合一般受眾。不過整碗拉麵的層次之豐富且鮮明，讓我不斷思考這真的是面向一般大眾的作品嗎？由於每日份量有限，我更願意將這款拉麵推薦給吃得懂的饕客。\n\n第一口是常見的鹹底湯頭、淺吃一口麵條，不經意撥動整碗湯，淡淡的桃香溫柔地在舌尖釋放，此後果香會如同芭蕾舞者輕盈躍動。接著夾起松阪豬搭配桃片，這瞬間法餐和日式拉麵的界線模糊了。湯頭裡的芝麻葉完美防守了味蕾疲乏的可能性，微微的苦味，更能嚐到水果的甜，到目前為止已經足夠美味，不過店家仍不輕易鬆懈，額外提供了松露奶油，確保食客直到最後一口都是不無聊且驚豔的。\n\n謝謝店家提供這麼美味的一份拉麵\n期待下期的作品🍜",null,[0,63]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhWm1GVWJGaE5NR2htVVc1V2MySkZiRFpWUkdSWldXeEdSMDFWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7306,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taZmFUbFhNMGhmUW5Wc2JFbDZVRGRZWWxGR01VRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x63b6665c240fb013!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkZfaTlXM0hfQnVsbEl6UDdYYlFGMUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taZmFUbFhNMGhmUW5