口味既溫潤又不膩口。麵條彈性適中，與湯頭完美結合；配料如叉燒、溏心蛋、雞肉等也處理得宜，整體呈現出細膩與創意兼具的風味，是值得一試的招牌選擇。\n\n蕉·味噌拉麵採用了蕉泥搭配八丁味噌的創意風格，但實際味道表現較為普通。蕉泥的香氣並未明顯融入味噌湯頭中，使得原本應該有特色的組合感覺有些模糊不清，整體厚度與層次稍嫌不足，對於喜歡傳統味噌拉麵的人來說可能不太合胃口。\n\n唐揚雞表現中規中矩。雖然外皮有一定的酥度，雞肉也保持基本的嫩度，但調味與口感上並沒有特別突出，整體表現普通。",null,[0,70]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18033818535709465641/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDYTJGRlpHOWFhekIzVGtaYVJWRnRaM3BqUlU1dldtdEdOR0ZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,23574,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCa2FFZG9aazB3TkZaRVFtZ3pjRU5vWmtGNGFFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x63b6665c240fb013!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlBkaEdoZk0wNFZEQmgzcENoZkF4aEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCa2FFZG9aazB3TkZaRVFtZ3pjRU5vWmtGNGFFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCa2FFZG9aazB3TkZaRVFtZ3pjRU5vWmtGNGFFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCa2FFZG9aazB3TkZaRVFtZ3pjRU5vWmtGNGFFRRILMG